WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:09.679
The concept of living in the moment is one
of great reverence amidst the human spirit.

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:16.890
It speaks on behalf of the enduring human
goal to obtain control over the swiftly escaping

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.550
creature that is time.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:24.770
To enjoy the life we have while we still have
it.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:33.290
Around 20 BC, a Roman poet named Horace coined
one of the first recorded and recognizable

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:38.129
versions of a phrase related to living in
the moment.

00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:45.140
The phrase being, “Carpe Diem,” which
translates into “seize the day.”

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:52.289
And ever since, this same idea of seizing
the day has been expressed in various ways

00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:57.809
as the concept has only continued to grow
in popularity.

00:00:57.809 --> 00:01:05.750
Very recently, it has seen another new iteration
with the rapper Drake’s acronym “YOLO,”

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.130
standing for “you only live once.”

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:16.600
Regardless of how it is said, the idea of
living in the moment is appealing and seductive

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:23.729
as it offers a way out of senseless living
patterns that cause us to throw away our time

00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:27.469
and neglect an appreciation of life.

00:01:27.469 --> 00:01:36.450
What’s interesting though, is that regardless
of its popularity over a span of 2,000 years,

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:43.680
living in the moment is still more of a hopeful
ideal than something that most people do.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:50.620
Arguably, this is because there is an inherent
conflict between living in the moment and

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.609
human nature itself.

00:01:52.609 --> 00:01:54.359
Living in the moment comes with uncertainty.

00:01:54.359 --> 00:01:55.359
And humans have an exceptionally difficult
time functioning with uncertainty.

00:01:55.359 --> 00:01:56.359
Uncertainty comes with fear, discomfort, and
a lack of control.

00:01:56.359 --> 00:01:57.359
And not only that, but most modern cultures
make it even more difficult by prioritizing

00:01:57.359 --> 00:01:58.359
planning, organization, and strategy in order
for someone to become successful.

00:01:58.359 --> 00:01:59.359
But we must stop and consider what it is we
are really striving for in this pursuit of

00:01:59.359 --> 00:02:00.359
control and success.

00:02:00.359 --> 00:02:01.359
Simply, we want our moments in life to be
the best they can be.

00:02:01.359 --> 00:02:02.549
But here lies our problem.

00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:10.369
The reason why we struggle to ever truly seize
the moment is because we try too hard.

00:02:10.369 --> 00:02:15.709
We try to perfect the moment instead of living
in it.

00:02:15.709 --> 00:02:22.950
We work to make sure that it is worthy and
refuse to accept it as it is.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:29.959
We combat the uncertainty of its quality with
planning and routine.

00:02:29.959 --> 00:02:35.970
But in the planning process, we use up all
of our moments.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:42.830
Every moment becomes a stepping-stone to the
next, assuming that what we will find in the

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:46.200
next will exceed the previous.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:51.890
And with this, no moment can ever exist for
itself.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:54.000
But it is not hopeless.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:01.300
The mere awareness of this conflict can help
us overcome it and find our way back into

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.230
this moment.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:10.830
We can use our need for certainty to be certain
that this moment is sufficient.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:17.180
More than planning, each moment requires an
appreciation for what it is.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:24.939
An improbable and astounding opportunity to
experience life as something that can understand

00:03:24.939 --> 00:03:28.290
the value of a moment at all.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:35.709
The odds of becoming a human are one in four
trillion and every moment we can say we beat

00:03:35.709 --> 00:03:40.239
those odds is invaluable.

00:03:40.239 --> 00:03:46.380
By spotlighting our consciousness on this
thought, we can begin to live more and more

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:52.690
in the moment and reduce the weight of our
concern for the next.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:04:00.709
Living in the moment is undoubtedly easier
said then done, but it is your duty to yourself.

00:04:00.709 --> 00:04:09.349
If you are not experiencing life and instead
life is experiencing you, this moment is your

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:13.400
only way out.

